# DRAFT - would live at .github/CODEOWNERS. Read from the base branch, so a PR cannot change
# its own owners. Last matching pattern wins.
#
# Assumes an org team containing kushti and jozanek with write access. Team review
# auto-assignment (load balance) then requests ONE of them instead of pinging both on every PR.
# Without a team, replace the team with "@kushti @jozanek".
#
# One code-owner approval = tier T1. T2 (both maintainers) is enforced by the ergo-tier check,
# because CODEOWNERS is satisfied by any single owner.

# T1 floor: every file needs a maintainer approval.
*                           @ergoplatform/node-maintainers

# T0: docs-only paths have no owner (no approval required; a maintainer still merges).
*.md
/papers/
/docs/

# Agent-steering, governance and decision files are owned again (they change how review works).
/AGENTS.md                  @ergoplatform/node-maintainers
/REVIEW.md                  @ergoplatform/node-maintainers
/SECURITY.md                @ergoplatform/node-maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @ergoplatform/node-maintainers
/docs/adr/                  @ergoplatform/node-maintainers
/docs/maintainer-model/     @ergoplatform/node-maintainers
/.github/                   @ergoplatform/node-maintainers
